=== Google Calendar Export and Removal ===

Export one recording or all recordings to a selected writable Google Calendar. Remove a single export or all GeoTracker calendar exports without deleting the original app activities. Bulk removal locates GeoTracker-tagged calendar rows directly, verifies deletion using exact row IDs, and requests calendar synchronization; it no longer reports misleading missing-export counts. Calendar access is required for these actions.

Reminder support includes the declared **SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM** permission and the app's exact-alarm permission request flow.

== Statistics and Analysis ==

=== Native App Analytics ===

* Weekly, monthly, and yearly statistics
* Per-sport-type yearly distance breakdown
* Total covered distance summary
* Route comparison and route similarity scoring
* Speed-distance chart
* Pace graph with percentile filtering
* Heart rate detail charts
* Heart rate vs distance
* Heart rate vs altitude
* Heart rate vs speed
* Altitude detail charts
* GPS and barometric altitude comparison
* Altitude profile for loaded tracks
* Reference marker on altitude graph
* Weather detail charts
* Barometer detail charts
